pull the thing off just like that?

77
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:20,060
Keep winning matches, and your head
gets to stay attached to your neck.

78
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:22,980
But step out of the
ring and you're a toast.

79
00:05:23,260 --> 00:05:24,797
You two are a team, by the way,

80
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:28,137
