day since you showed up.

161
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:27,480
But if you can protect Yoguro,
that's all that matters.

162
00:11:32,260 --> 00:11:34,960
I'm counting on you, Lufitaro.

163
00:11:41,020 --> 00:11:42,180
It's a raid

164
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:54,300
That's Hawkins He's a headliner from
the Beast Pirates No one moves an inch

165
00:11:55,300 --> 00:11:58,880
This is a bathhouse What
could you want from us?

166
00:11:59,080 --> 00:12:02,797
A bathhouse is perfect for
our job today If everyone's

167
00:12:02,880 --> 00:12:05,821
naked that means they can't
hide anything from us.

168
